  "prefLabel": "Med 102.05 Physician",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Med 102.05 \"Physician\" means a doctor of medicine or a doctor of osteopathy who holds a current license to practice issued by the board pursuant to RSA 329.\n\nSource. #6554, eff 7-31-97",
